<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="about2">
    <div class="about2__bio panel">
      <div class="about__photo">
        {% image "img/site/headshot.jpg", "Aaron Beaudoin, smiling, in a dark suit and blue tie.", "(min-width: 60rem) 22rem, 90vw", [400, 800] %}
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="about2__lead">Aaron is a UX designer and builder who takes products from user research to a working app.</p>
        <p>Before UX, he spent seven years in sales leadership and ran his own sports bar, which taught him to listen to what people actually need. Most recently he researched, designed, and built <a href="/design/rinkside-b2c/">Rinkside</a>, an app for ice skaters and ice rinks, now in alpha on iOS and Android. A degree in astrophysics means he's at home in data and code.</p>
        <p>Outside of design, Aaron plays hockey, snowboards, rock climbs, hikes, and camps in the Colorado Rockies.</p>
        <p class="about2__where"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="16" height="16"><path d="M10 18s6-5.2 6-10a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 4.8 6 10 6 10Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"/></svg> Based in the {{ site.location }}.</p>
        <div class="button-row">
          {%- if site.resume %}<a class="button" href="{{ site.resume }}">Download my resume <span class="visually-hidden">(PDF)</span></a>{% endif %}
          <a class="button button--ghost" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email me</a>
          <button class="button button--ghost" type="button" data-copy="{{ site.email }}" hidden>Copy email</button>
        </div>
        <p class="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about2__info panel prose">
      <h2 class="visually-hidden">Timeline</h2>
      <ul class="when-list" role="list">
        <li><p class="when-list__when">Currently</p><p>Designing <a href="/design/rinkside-b2b/">Rinkside for rinks</a>, a platform to run the whole rink, while two hockey teams test the Rinkside skater app.</p></li>
        <li><p class="when-list__when">2026</p><p>Researched, designed, and built <a href="/design/rinkside-b2c/">Rinkside</a>, from booking tests at three Denver rinks to a working alpha on iOS, Android, and the web. Earned the Google UX Design Certificate.</p></li>
        <li><p class="when-list__when">2025</p><p>Won the Cellular Sales market award for most B2B new activations, out of 150 reps.</p></li>
        <li><p class="when-list__when">2024 — 2026</p><p>Designed and launched a regional B2B sales program for 150 reps across 20 stores in two states, and owned 125+ Verizon Business accounts.</p></li>
        <li><p class="when-list__when">2022 — 2024</p><p>Opened and ran <a href="/design/stix-crafthouse/">STiX Crafthouse</a>, a hockey bar in Arvada, and did all of its branding. The Denver Post named it one of Denver's 9 best sports bars a month after opening.</p></li>
        <li><p class="when-list__when">2016 — 2022</p><p>Led and coached sales teams of up to 25 at Credico and Cellular Sales, and opened offices in Utah, Michigan, and Colorado.</p></li>
        <li><p class="when-list__when">2013 — 2016</p><p>Did astrophysics <a href="/research/">research</a> at the University of Illinois and the National Radio Astronomy Observatory, including test software published as an NRAO technical note.</p></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Education</h2>
      <p><strong>University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign</strong><br>B.S., Astronomy and Astrophysics; Minor, Theoretical Physics<br><span class="card__meta">2010 — 2015 · Dean's List</span></p>

      <h2>Certification</h2>
      <p><strong>Google UX Design Professional Certificate</strong><br><span class="card__meta">Coursera · October 2026 ·</span> <a href="https://coursera.org/verify/professional-cert/2TP0FVZ5WMDM">Verify the certificate</a></p>

      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <dl class="skills">
        <div><dt>UX &amp; design</dt><dd>User research, interviews, surveys, competitive analysis, journey mapping, user stories, wireframing, prototyping, accessibility auditing, Figma, FigJam, Canva</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Build &amp; AI</dt><dd>Claude Code, Claude API, Expo / React Native, Next.js, Supabase, Clerk, Vercel, GitHub</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Data &amp; tools</dt><dd>Power BI, Salesforce, Excel, Python, SQL, Google Workspace</dd></div>
      </dl>

      <h2>Connect</h2>
      <ul class="connect" role="list">
        <li><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ site.linkedin }}">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ site.github }}">GitHub</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  // "Copy email": shown only when the browser can copy to the clipboard.
  (function () {
    var button = document.querySelector("[data-copy]");
    var status = document.querySelector(".copy-status");
    if (!button || !navigator.clipboard) return;
    button.hidden = false;
    button.addEventListener("click", function () {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(button.dataset.copy).then(function () {
        status.textContent = "Copied " + button.dataset.copy + " to your clipboard.";
      }, function () {
        status.textContent = "Couldn't copy. My email is " + button.dataset.copy + ".";
      });
    });
  })();
</script>
